}(1,1)$. Hence, the line cuts the square  into two quadrilaterals of equal  area $1/2$. Thus the area of the trapezoid is $3/2$ and the probability is $\boxed{\frac{3}{4}}$.

[asy]
draw((-1,0)--(4,0),Arrow);
