label("$C$", C, SE);
label("$D$", D, S);
[/asy]

Then
\[\frac{\sin \angle BAD}{\sin \angle CAD} = \frac{\frac{BD \sqrt{3}}{2 AD}}{\frac{CD}{AD \sqrt{2}}} = \frac{BD \sqrt{6}}{2 CD} = \boxed{\frac{\sqrt{6}}{6}}.\]

